  <!-- EXPERT BLOCK 1 — CO-FOUNDER -->
  <section style="background:#F5E6D8;padding:84px 28px;">
    <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
      <div style="font-size:12px;letter-spacing:0.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#C9653F;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:32px;">Meet our co-founder</div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:52px;align-items:center;margin-bottom:48px;">
        <div>
          <img class="wk-cofounder-img" src="{{ 'wk-cofounder-katie.jpg' | asset_url }}" alt="Dr. Katie Chen, Co-founder & Medical Director, in her practice" width="800" height="800" loading="lazy" style="width:100%;height:auto;aspect-ratio:1/1;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top;border-radius:14px;display:block;">
        </div>
        <div>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:14px;">
            <span style="font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:0.2em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07E81;font-weight:600;">Dr. Katie Chen, MD, MSCP</span>
            <span style="font-size:10px;letter-spacing:0.14em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6B3D42;font-weight:700;border:1.5px solid #6B3D42;border-radius:999px;padding:3px 10px;">Co-founder &amp; Medical Director</span>
          </div>
          <h2 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:31px;line-height:1.12;margin:0 0 20px;color:#6B3D42;max-width:26ch;">I co-founded Womankind to build the formula I wanted for my own patients</h2>
          <p style="font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.68;color:#4a3a30;margin:0 0 22px;font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;">"For years I watched women arrive in my office at forty-three — dismissed, confused, and told their labs were normal — with nothing on the shelf I could honestly recommend. So I helped build it. Every active is named and dosed, nothing I couldn't stand behind in a consult. This is the formula I wanted for my patients, and for myself."</p>
          <div style="display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
            <span style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-style:italic;font-size:22px;color:#6B3D42;">Dr. Katie Chen</span>
            <span style="font-size:11px;letter-spacing:0.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A07E81;font-weight:600;">Board-certified OB/GYN · Menopause Society Certified Practitioner (MSCP)</span>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:30px;">
        <div style="border-top:2px solid #C9653F;padding-top:18px;">
          <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 9px;color:#6B3D42;">Standardised botanicals</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a3a30;margin:0;">Black cohosh and red clover at the doses used in the research — for hot flashes and night sweats specifically.*</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:2px solid #C9653F;padding-top:18px;">
          <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 9px;color:#6B3D42;">The gut connection</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a3a30;margin:0;">A probiotic blend for the estrobolome means we're supporting how the body actually handles estrogen.*</p>
        </div>
        <div style="border-top:2px solid #C9653F;padding-top:18px;">
          <h3 style="font-family:'Fraunces',serif;font-weight:500;font-size:18px;margin:0 0 9px;color:#6B3D42;">No hormones, no sugar</h3>
          <p style="font-size:14px;line-height:1.6;color:#4a3a30;margin:0;">A daily she can take for years without trade-offs — clean, transparent, and built for the long transition.*</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

